    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201600702/2016007020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016007020130,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "す、すみません、ぶつかってしまって……\r\n大丈夫でしたか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600702/2016007020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、あぁ……こっちこそすまない\r\n集中してる時に……──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "というか、今日はレッスンの日じゃなかったよな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016007020140,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……は、はい\r\nええと、歌の、自主レッスンを……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600702/2016007020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……千雪\r\n最近、何かあったのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016007020150,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "…………あ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600702/2016007020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016007020160,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……すみません、\r\n余計なご心配をおかけしてしまって……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600702/2016007020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016007020170,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……実は、歌のレッスンで",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600702/2016007020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016007020180,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "トレーナーさんから、もっと気持ちを込めるようにと\r\nご指導をいただいたんです",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600702/2016007020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016007020190,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "それで、詞の内容を自分なりに理解しようとして\r\n色々と試してたんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600702/2016007020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "具体的には？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "力みすぎてる\r\nように見えるよ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "それこそ……",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……色々試したって言ってたからさ\r\nどんなことをしたのかなって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016007020200,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あ、その……！　詞と同じことをしてみようと\r\n思いまして、メイクを変えてみたり……とか……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600702/2016007020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、\r\nこの前のはそういうことだったのか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016007020210,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "は、はい～…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600702/2016007020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けど……\r\nうーん、そうか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "例えば、物語を読むみたいな気持ちで\r\n歌詞について考えてみるのはどうだ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪、そういうのは得意そうだしさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016007020220,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "──歌詞を、物語として……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600702/2016007020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016007020230,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……そっか\r\nなんだか、光が見えた気がします～……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600702/2016007020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016007020240,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、ありがとうございます！\r\n私、やってみますね……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600702/2016007020240"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "無理に詞のことだけを考えなくてもさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もっと自然に、千雪なりの気持ちを\r\n込めてみればいいんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なんて\r\nあんまり俺が偉そうに言えることじゃないけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
